{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EPIC QUESTS. INSTANT ADVENTURES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the magic of Dungeons &amp; Dragons like never before in this tactical, cooperative digital board game set in Forgotten Realms. Command your heroes, unravel sinister plots and forge mighty alliances in turn-based combat and choice-based storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Iconic D&amp;D Elements with Streamlined Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From recognizable settings and classic D&amp;D classes - like paladin, sorcerer, ranger and rogue -  to fiery explosions and divine healing, Battlemarked delivers quick, pick-up-and-play action for players of every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/ec9e19ac6f5676723f4ed6cd63b7be6d.poster.avif?t=1759413618\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/ec9e19ac6f5676723f4ed6cd63b7be6d.webm?t=1759413618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/ec9e19ac6f5676723f4ed6cd63b7be6d.mp4?t=1759413618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical, Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use unique card abilities and adapt your approach in turn-based battles that reward strategic planning\u2014combine abilities, control the battlefield, and adjust your tactics with every draw to overcome ever-changing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/0b4cff4f7d9c6ed0c44cd81897e39e9f.poster.avif?t=1759413618\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/0b4cff4f7d9c6ed0c44cd81897e39e9f.webm?t=1759413618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/0b4cff4f7d9c6ed0c44cd81897e39e9f.mp4?t=1759413618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collaborate to Victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can tackle adventures together \u2014 coordinating moves, setting traps, and combining abilities for maximum impact. Teamwork isn\u2019t optional \u2014 it\u2019s your most powerful weapon. Prefer to go alone? You can also command your party in skirmish mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/488ca75b3da7fe658d24d4da10179cb9.poster.avif?t=1759413618\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/488ca75b3da7fe658d24d4da10179cb9.webm?t=1759413618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/488ca75b3da7fe658d24d4da10179cb9.mp4?t=1759413618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable Adventures, Multiple Campaigns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Neverwinter Wood, Cragmaw Castle, and more in two campaigns at launch, with additional DLC adventures on the horizon. Every run changes, keeping each session fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and prepare for your next great tactical adventure in the Dungeons &amp; Dragons universe on November 20.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3124340?t=1759413618","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/c85b84e7cab62479d47775f3db673d4da229aae2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759413618","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/7e29d9550551e51213735e55f367e896ec05d202/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759413618","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/7e29d9550551e51213735e55f367e896ec05d202/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759413618","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EPIC QUESTS. INSTANT ADVENTURES.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the magic of Dungeons &amp; Dragons like never before in this tactical, cooperative digital board game set in Forgotten Realms. Command your heroes, unravel sinister plots and forge mighty alliances in turn-based combat and choice-based storytelling.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Iconic D&amp;D Elements with Streamlined Strategy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From recognizable settings and classic D&amp;D classes - like paladin, sorcerer, ranger and rogue -  to fiery explosions and divine healing, Battlemarked delivers quick, pick-up-and-play action for players of every level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/ec9e19ac6f5676723f4ed6cd63b7be6d.poster.avif?t=1759413618\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/ec9e19ac6f5676723f4ed6cd63b7be6d.webm?t=1759413618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/ec9e19ac6f5676723f4ed6cd63b7be6d.mp4?t=1759413618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical, Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use unique card abilities and adapt your approach in turn-based battles that reward strategic planning\u2014combine abilities, control the battlefield, and adjust your tactics with every draw to overcome ever-changing challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/0b4cff4f7d9c6ed0c44cd81897e39e9f.poster.avif?t=1759413618\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/0b4cff4f7d9c6ed0c44cd81897e39e9f.webm?t=1759413618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/0b4cff4f7d9c6ed0c44cd81897e39e9f.mp4?t=1759413618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collaborate to Victory</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players can tackle adventures together \u2014 coordinating moves, setting traps, and combining abilities for maximum impact. Teamwork isn\u2019t optional \u2014 it\u2019s your most powerful weapon. Prefer to go alone? You can also command your party in skirmish mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/488ca75b3da7fe658d24d4da10179cb9.poster.avif?t=1759413618\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/488ca75b3da7fe658d24d4da10179cb9.webm?t=1759413618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/extras/488ca75b3da7fe658d24d4da10179cb9.mp4?t=1759413618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Replayable Adventures, Multiple Campaigns</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Neverwinter Wood, Cragmaw Castle, and more in two campaigns at launch, with additional DLC adventures on the horizon. Every run changes, keeping each session fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist now and prepare for your next great tactical adventure in the Dungeons &amp; Dragons universe on November 20.</strong></p>","developers":["Resolution Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3124340/e84e86b7f23617e609d221a3b7b6716ec0aabf87/header.jpg?t=1759413618","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"DUNGEONS & DRAGONS is a trademark of Wizards of the Coast LLC and is used with permission. \u00a92025 Wizards of the Coast. \u00a92025 Resolution Games AB. All Rights Reserved. Demeo is a trademark of Resolution Games AB.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3124340/792990675/448d2c4c31be8784cc58dc64b2bfbfa2261bef3d/1759321478/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759413614","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3124340/792990675/448d2c4c31be8784cc58dc64b2bfbfa2261bef3d/1759321478/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759413614","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3124340/792990675/448d2c4c31be8784cc58dc64b2bfbfa226